TITLE 1D transport with exchange
SOLUTION 0 Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    equilibrate 1
    X 0.001
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 10*1
    -dispersivities 10*0
    -correct_disp false
    -punch_cells 1
    -punch_frequency 1
END
